---
// FPT 2025 audited Income Statement (Form B 02 - DN/HN) vs one-off gain mask pattern.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

const W = 900;
const H = 290;
---
<figure class="sbp6-pl">
  <div class="sbp6-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Comparing FPT's audited 2025 Income Statement (Net revenue 70,113B, Gross profit 25,889B = 36.9% margin, Net operating profit 12,952B vs tiny Net other income 92B) against a hypothetical one-off asset-sale mask.">
      <text x="20" y="30" class="sbp6-title">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Minute 3 Income Statement quality: FPT 2025 audited vs one-off gain trap</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Phút 3 Soi Kết quả kinh doanh: FPT 2025 kiểm toán vs bẫy lãi bán tài sản một lần</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* FPT 2025 Real */}
      <rect x="20" y="54" width="420" height="214" rx="10" class="sbp6-card-green" />
      <DiagramIcon name="ok" x={48} y={84} size={24} />
      <text x="74" y="88" class="sbp6-hdr sbp6-green">
        <tspan data-lang-en>FPT 2025 Audited — Core Engine</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>FPT 2025 Kiểm toán — Lãi từ lõi bền vững</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="38" y="122" class="sbp6-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Net Revenue (10): 70,112.8B VND (+11.6% YoY)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Doanh thu thuần (10): 70.112,8 tỷ (+11,6% cùng kỳ)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="38" y="150" class="sbp6-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Gross Profit (20): 25,888.5B VND (36.9% margin)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Lãi gộp (20): 25.888,5 tỷ (biên gộp 36,9%)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="38" y="178" class="sbp6-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Operating Profit (30): 12,951.7B | Net Other (40): +92.0B</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Lãi thuần HĐKD (30): 12.951,7 tỷ | Khác (40): +92 tỷ</tspan>
      </text>
      <line x1="38" y1="202" x2="420" y2="202" class="sbp6-sep" />
      <text x="38" y="232" class="sbp6-sub sbp6-green">
        <tspan data-lang-en>PAT (60): 11,232.3B (99.3% from recurring business!)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>LNST (60): 11.232,3 tỷ (99,3% từ kinh doanh chính!)</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* One-off trap benchmark */}
      <rect x="460" y="54" width="420" height="214" rx="10" class="sbp6-card-red" />
      <DiagramIcon name="warning" x={488} y={84} size={24} />
      <text x="514" y="88" class="sbp6-hdr sbp6-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Red-Flag Pattern — One-Off Sale Mask</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Mẫu Cạm Bẫy — Lãi đột biến che lỗ lõi</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="478" y="122" class="sbp6-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Net Revenue (10): drops −15% YoY</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Doanh thu thuần (10): sụt giảm −15% cùng kỳ</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="478" y="150" class="sbp6-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Gross Profit (20): squeezed below SG&amp;A + Interest</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Lãi gộp (20): mỏng hơn chi phí BH/QLDN &amp; lãi vay</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="478" y="178" class="sbp6-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Core Ops: loss −22B + Land/Sub sale (21/40): +210B!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Lỗ kinh doanh −22 tỷ + Lãi bán đất/CP (21/40): +210 tỷ!</tspan>
      </text>
      <line x1="478" y1="202" x2="860" y2="202" class="sbp6-sep" />
      <text x="478" y="232" class="sbp6-sub sbp6-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Headline PAT: +150B (vanishes once asset is sold)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>LNST vẫn +150 tỷ (năm sau hết tài sản để bán!)</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>In FPT's Form B 02, Code 40 (Net other income) contributed just 92B out of 13,044B pre-tax profit (0.7%), whereas Code 20 (Gross profit) and Code 30 (Operating profit) drove everything — the opposite of a one-off asset-sale spike.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Trên Mẫu B 02 của FPT, mã 40 (Lợi nhuận khác) chỉ đóng góp 92 tỷ trên 13.044 tỷ LNTT (0,7%), còn gần như toàn bộ lợi nhuận đi lên thẳng từ Lãi gộp (mã 20) và Lãi hoạt động chính (mã 30).</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp6-pl { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp6-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp6-pl svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp6-pl text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp6-title { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp6-card-green { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp6-card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp6-hdr { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp6-green { fill: var(--act-2); }
  .sbp6-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp6-body { font-size: 12.2px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .sbp6-sub { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp6-sep { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .sbp6-pl figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
